rooms_desc ({"As you walk in to the house, you notice the foyer has been decorated in a Victorian flavor. There is a hat rack where you can store your coat andand shoes, because shoes aren't allowed anywhere outside this room. The wallsare decorated with wallpaper that looks like tapestries, and the tin ceilingrounds out the room, along with the hardwood floors.","Hammar has lost his mind. this room is bare to be a reminder to all thatIt can happen to you too. :)",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
